Sun Sep 27 08:19:02 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Bump monorepo_ver to 0.62.3; this package's own version stays
  0.5.2, because the in-tree pyproject.toml declares 0.5.2 at
  both monorepo tags
  * The packages/opentelemetry-semantic-conventions-ai subdirectory
    is byte-identical to 0.62.1, so this refresh carries no code
    change
  * The two upstream fixes in 0.62.2 and 0.62.3 are in
    traceloop-sdk and the openai-agents and litellm
    instrumentation packages, which this package neither
    builds nor ships
  * Requires are unchanged at opentelemetry-sdk >= 1.42.0 and
    opentelemetry-semantic-conventions >= 0.63b1, re-verified
    against the 0.62.3 tarball

